     "hail-ply",
     "hail-ply-snorlax"
    ],
    "sourceBattlerRule": "battler 0 only: DoFieldEndTurnEffects (battle_util.c:1186) sets gBattlerAttacker to the first non-absent battler and BattleScript_RainContinuesOrEnds / BattleScript_DamagingWeatherContinues play on BS_ATTACKER (Drizzle / Sand Stream: BS_BATTLER_0); gAbsentBattlerFlags is set only by Cmd_openpartyscreen when no replacement exists, which ends a singles battle before another end turn, so every Factory instance is on battler 0 whichever side set the weather (ply / opp setter jobs here: all on battler 0). The kernel's event battler may say 1 (the last attacker): a field divergence."
   },
